BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fae119f3698addb4a8e63356@greenville-kid-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261017T134223Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T120000
SUMMARY:TD Saturday Market- Downtown Greenville
LOCATION:Downtown Greenville\, Main Street\, Greenville\, SC\, 29601\, Unit
 ed States
DESCRIPTION:Each Saturday morning from early May through late October\, two
  blocks of downtown Greenville’s Main Street are transformed into the TD
  Saturday Market\, a vibrant open-air marketplace in the heart of the city
 . The market features more than 75 vendors offering seasonal produce\, pre
 pared foods\, and handcrafted goods\, creating a lively community gatherin
 g space every week. LEARN MORE HERE 🥕 Greenville Saturday Market\, SC -
  Official Website | Official Website Find special market happenings each w
 eek right here > Market Happenings | Greenville Saturday Market\, SC - Off
 icial Website Check for cancellations and special events on the TD Saturda
 y Market Instagram What to Expect Fresh\, seasonal produce from farms loca
 ted within 100 miles of Greenville Locally produced and prepared food item
 s Handmade crafts and artisan goods Vendors encouraged to use locally sour
 ced materials for crafts Experience The TD Saturday Market draws thousands
  of visitors each week who come to shop\, explore\, and connect with local
  growers\, makers\, and artisans in a welcoming downtown setting. Why Visi
 t It’s a long-standing Greenville tradition that highlights local agricu
 lture\, craftsmanship\, and community. The market offers a chance to exper
 ience the best of the region in one place every Saturday morning. Source: 
 Downtown Greenville. Check the linked organizer page before leaving.
URL:https://kiddingaroundgreenville.com/events/td-saturday-market-downtown-
 greenville-2026-10-17
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0a0954bfc58018c34639a954@greenville-kid-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261017T134223Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T113000
SUMMARY:[3+] Story Hour at SC Children's Theatre
LOCATION:South Carolina Children's Theatre\, 153 Augusta Street\, Greenvill
 e\, SC\, United States
DESCRIPTION:Little ones can enjoy a high-energy\, kid-friendly storytime at
  SC Children's Theatre! A Teaching Artist brings a story by Aaron Reynolds
  to life in the Prisma Health Lobby with audience participation and simple
  interaction. Performances last no longer than 30 minutes\, so they're per
 fect for wiggly young patrons. Shows at 10am and 11am. Reservations aren't
  required\, and the parking lot fee is waived for story time patrons. Sour
 ce: South Carolina Children's Theatre. Check the linked organizer page bef
 ore leaving.
URL:https://kiddingaroundgreenville.com/events/story-hour-at-sc-childrens-t
 heatre
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
