SUMMARY:Prisma Health Boo in the Zoo - Greenville Zoo
LOCATION:The Greenville Zoo\, 150 Cleveland Park Drive\, Greenville\, SC\, 
 United States
DESCRIPTION:The Greenville Zoo's family-friendly Halloween tradition return
 s with trick-or-treating\, Dragon Alley\, Ghost Town\, and a glowing light
  tunnel. Costumes encouraged! Dates & Hours: October 14th - 31st\, 2026\; 
 3 pm - 8 pm Open Halloween from 1 pm - 4 pm Trick-or-Treat Upgrade require
 d per participant Limited discounted tickets online - buy early $2 upcharg
 e at the ticket booth Bring your own trick-or-treat bag Boo Babies (ages 0
 –2) are free\, but candy requires an upgrade Children must be with an ad
 ult Link: https://www.greenvillezoo.com/boo-in-the-zoo Source: Greenville 
 Zoo. Check the linked organizer page before leaving.
URL:https://kiddingaroundgreenville.com/events/prisma-health-boo-in-the-zoo
 -greenville-zoo-4
END:VEVENT
