SUMMARY:[3+] I Want My Hat Back - SCCT
LOCATION:South Carolina Children's Theatre\, 153 Augusta Street\, Greenvill
 e\, SC\, United States
DESCRIPTION:A Musical Adventure Based on Jon Klassen's Beloved Picture Book
  Bear's hat is gone\, and he wants it back! He asks all the animals in the
  forest\, but no one has seen it... or have they? Join Bear on this rollic
 king musical adventure full of deadpan humor\, zany characters\, and cleve
 r physical comedy as he searches for his beloved red hat. Based on Jon Kla
 ssen's celebrated picture book\, this production invites kids and grown-up
 s alike to think about honesty\, empathy\, and the choices we make — all
  while immersing them in a world that's as clever as it is unforgettable. 
 "I Want My Hat Back mixes Jon Klassen's signature deadpan humor with cleve
 r physical comedy\, zany characters\, and lively music that keeps audience
 s laughing from start to finish... this production invites kids\, young an
 d old alike\, to think about honesty\, empathy\, and the choices we make
 —not just following what we want—while fully immersing them in a world
  that's as clever as it is unforgettable." — Peggy Trecker White On Sale
  Now! Saturday\, October 24 at 10:30 AM Saturday\, October 24 at 2:00 PM S
 unday\, October 25 at 2:00 PM Sunday\, October 25 at 4:30 PM - Pay What Yo
 u Can on sale 10/15/26 Saturday\, October 31 at 10:30 AM Saturday\, Octobe
 r 31 at 2:00 PM Sunday\, November 1 at 2:00 PM Saturday\, November 7 at 10
